<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP FIXES ZLOTY UP VS DLR AT 2.8520.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP FIXES ZLOTY UP VS DLR AT 2.8520.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8520 against the dollar, up from 2.8535 yesterday and at 1.8530 against the mark, down from 1.8470, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
